[en.DECISION_FOREST_CULTIVATION]
Forest Cultivation

[en.DECISION_FOREST_CULTIVATION_desc]
Carry out the construction of industrial forest farms in the territory and plant fast-growing forests, making the target area quickly become an industrial round wood production area.

[zh.DECISION_FOREST_CULTIVATION]
林场培养

[zh.DECISION_FOREST_CULTIVATION_desc]
在属地开展工业林场建设，种植速生林，使得目标地区快速成为工业圆木产区。
